1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,885
You wake at
midnight

2
00:00:00,885 --> 00:00:02,985
in a sunlit
bedroom.

3
00:00:02,985 --> 00:00:04,900
The Sun
never sets.

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:07,260
Earth still turns
once per year,

5
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:08,160
keeping the same

6
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,010
face toward
the Sun.

7
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,080
You scout a
darker home.

8
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,930
Now sunset is a
place, not a time.

9
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,680
You reach
darkness.

10
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:18,680
But darkness
is not

11
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,460
automatically frozen:

12
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:22,630
air and oceans
can carry heat.

13
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,040
Your solar panels
stay dark.

14
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:26,020
This home
would need

15
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,550
another power
source.

16
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,140
You choose a
twilight home:

17
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,300
light nearby,

18
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,250
darkness just
down the road.

19
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:36,440
Then clouds steal
your light.

20
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:37,280
Good thing
your new

21
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,170
home has
backup power.

22
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,380
Back home,

23
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,780
you make night
with blinds.

24
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,380
Tomorrow's
sunset waits

25
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,730
exactly where
you left it.
